# Line endings are pinned only where they affect a shipped artifact.
#
# There used to be one such rule here: *.bat text eol=crlf, for
# build\launcher.bat. The launcher is now a compiled exe produced by
# build\publish.ps1 from build\launcher\Launcher.cs, so nothing in this
# repository lands inside a release archive as a working-tree file any more,
# and pinning .ps1 would only force a repo-wide reformat for no gain.
#
# Note for anyone adding a rule back: git applies attributes on checkout
# according to the per-machine core.autocrlf, so anything that ends up inside
# an artifact is safer built than copied.